# PAGE-KEYS-SETTINGS-COLUMN: PgDn and PgUp in /settings' menu and in its
# Model row's list, at 24 rows, where a page is inputRowLimit(20) = 11
# (input_completion_runtime.zig:222-233@481104fd). The menu lists 14
# settings (settings_catalog.zig:261-276) and the list thirty models, so a
# page lands inside both. A page past either end goes to the other end, not
# round it (Menu.move, settings_catalog.zig:225-241; moveVisibleItems,
# model_cache_runtime.zig:229-245): 11 then 0, and from 0 the last. C-j and
# C-k walk the same lists one row (routePickerControlByte, :1093-1108 of
# app_input_runtime.zig); they come last, after Tab has closed the list and
# moved to the Interface tab, so a release that types them as a newline in
# the search spoils no snap before them. The list is opened from a menu
# opened again, so where the pages before left the mark does not matter.
# fx's harness launches it with FX_SOUND=0; xfx is given the same start.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
models p5-input-row-limit-models.json
seed p5-effort-fork-seed-astra.json
nomodel
wait 3
xfx: wait 1
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1.2
snap menu
key NPage
wait 0.6
snap menu-pgdn
key NPage
wait 0.6
snap menu-pgdn2
key PPage
wait 0.6
snap menu-pgup
key PPage
wait 0.6
snap menu-pgup2
key Escape
wait 0.7
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1.2
key Down Down Down Down Down
wait 0.3
key Right
wait 1.5
snap list
key NPage
wait 0.6
snap list-pgdn
key NPage
wait 0.6
snap list-pgdn2
key NPage
wait 0.6
snap list-pgdn3
key PPage
wait 0.6
snap list-pgup
key C-j
wait 0.5
snap list-cj
key C-k
wait 0.5
snap list-ck
key Tab
wait 0.8
snap tab
key C-j
wait 0.5
snap menu-cj
key C-k
wait 0.5
snap menu-ck
